{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_01",
  "title": "源石蟲農家樂",
  "storyCode": "DT-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb5a173729438319166df968f5bafdb30c660cbd2c13c53d16ae2ba1d4ba59cc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是覺得哪裡很奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊歐斯！都這種時候了，你怎麼還在亂想！我不覺得我們逃到這裡來那個獸人就不會發現我們了啊！他要是追到這裡來了怎麼辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你一點危機意識都沒有嗎！這裡可是從來沒有人知道的地方，所有的知識都不適用了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒想到這些蟲子外殼不同，習性和攻擊性也都不一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，牠們為什麼會跟那個像獸人一樣壯的生物一起行動，這些蟲子難道真的有可以被馴化的智力嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——小聲一點，那個獸人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）他、他過來了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）天啊！他怎麼在攻擊這些蟲子？所以他們並不是同伴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）他是在無差別地攻擊身邊的生物嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等等，我有個想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要做什麼！萊歐斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗨？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我受夠了！既然這樣，要來就來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾！等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了法琳，我可不能在這裡被未知的恐怖獸人殺掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰說要殺……我不殺你們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我看起來這麼兇惡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不用再廢話了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，小心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐怖獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下子最後一隻也解決了，這些亂跑出來的小東西，真不讓人放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你果然不是無差別攻擊人的恐怖狂暴獸人……！你只是想把這些蟲子都處理掉……我就知道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不是恐怖獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "54_g1_bobfarm"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不是恐怖獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你們第一次來這裡，也難怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不是恐怖獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡其實是我的一個小農場，木屋是我和其他人在這裡搭的，為了管住這些源石蟲我們可是下了不少的功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你們叫我大鮑勃就好。看你們像一群流浪漢的樣子，荒野上不好混，都在這休息休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "流、流浪漢……我們好歹也是冒險者吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那不就是流浪漢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來這種生物叫“源石蟲”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開什麼玩笑，說得好像你第一次聽說源石蟲一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我們還沒有自我介紹吧？我叫萊歐斯，這位是先西，是我們不久前認識的夥伴。這位是魔法師瑪露希爾，這位是鎖匠奇爾查克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你們穿著打扮蠻怪的，你們是在藍卡塢演戲的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算了，感覺說什麼你們都不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是怎麼搞的，一般人看到這麼多源石蟲早就躲遠了，你們怎麼還偏要跑過來？剛才牠們是把你們當成入侵者打了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來這座農場是你用來飼養這些源石蟲的！你真是很了不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，這算什麼，只是這種小東西在這裡有不少，與其在荒野中跟牠們作對，還不如想點辦法把牠們養起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個季節剛好是牠們活動的時候，我才專門到這個木屋來待著。沒想到今天被你們搶先了，幫我喚醒了牠們，還弄得到處都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒辦法，只能一隻一隻把牠們揍暈再帶回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，不好意思……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，沒關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是，牠們可以用來……吃嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯？！你在說什麼？剛才牠們襲擊你的樣子你忘了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且現在不是可以花時間來想吃飯的事情的時候！我們還得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我們的確會吃源石蟲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯&先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是牠們看起來很危險……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜是因為牠們有什麼特殊的風味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是，與其說是風味，不如說是……唉，講不清楚！不如你們親自試試吧，等我用這源石蟲做一頓飯給你們就知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那老夫也來幫幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要吃這些蟲子？！不行！不行不行！不吃不吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫已經把鍋子洗好了，大鮑勃，請讓老夫見識一下你是如何處理這些蟲子的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！首先，我們剛抓到的源石蟲是不能直接食用的，我們需要把牠們翻過來放在水中禁食五天，讓牠們的腸胃充分清空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不會是要從現在開始等五天吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的要等五天的話你們就餓死了，我這有現成的。一定要戴好手套，把牠們用水簡單地煮一煮。牠們的肉煮後會收縮，方便剝掉外殼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不能直接剝嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不能，因為這樣煮其實也是為了清理內部的黏液。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用煮太久，斷生了就可以撈出來了，然後再剝掉殼，沖掉雜質。看到這些黏液了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……好像史萊姆……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？你不知道史萊姆？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "史萊姆，可是迷宮淺層中最常見的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "取出源石蟲肉後，可以把殼繼續用水加熱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！認真聽我說話啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "肉的話，現在依然還有大量的黏液。一邊加檸檬，一邊加鹽和麵粉，用力搓洗，把上面這些黏液都洗掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去掉內臟……撕掉外面的這層膜……來回搓洗五遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些內臟和膜都不能吃嗎？史萊姆整個都很好吃的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是你不想看到明天的太陽的話，倒是可以吃吃看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你聽到這句話才願意把牠從嘴邊拿開嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然要這麼細緻地處理……即使是老夫知道的食材裡面，也很少有食物需要如此仔細地來回清洗這麼多遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……畢竟是源石蟲，比一般的生物危害性更高，這一步是一定不能省的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是在我的農場裡面養殖的、被控制過生存環境的源石蟲，也一定要仔細清洗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是遇到野生的，你們千萬別自己去弄來吃，洗了幾十次也不能吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來很麻煩的樣子，能不能再快一點？……快一點點也好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，越是這種食物越要仔細處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一步處理完之後，找來帶有香味的植物，就是那邊帶刺植物的枝條和葉子，倒進鍋裡，再重新煮沸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還要再煮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不要這麼著急，長耳朵！只有這樣做，才能好好地去除源石蟲身上的土腥味，並讓肉軟下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過不在意吃到土腥味的話，也可以不放帶香味的植物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還是放吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們就狠狠加辣椒，辣到吃了會覺得自己能噴火的那種。然後——多加木柴，燒大火！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來就沒什麼特別的了。炒香幾種配料，倒入切好的源石蟲肉爆炒，肉捲邊了就是熟了。再炒肉變乾了就沒辦法吃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記得，捲邊，就剛好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？我漏了一步，剛剛應該淋上一圈源石蟲啤酒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用了不用了！這樣就算做好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總算做完了，做完了就快點吃吧！快點吃完快點繼續趕路，不用再花時間重新加工了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也可以，不是什麼大問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，辣炒源石蟲就算做好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大鬍子，你幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫也來試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些殼是已經清洗乾淨了的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他要做什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把洗乾淨的蟲肉填回殼裡去，把大蒜切成碎末，拌上一點奶油、胡椒和鹽……不要忘了剛剛漏掉的一步，淋上一圈源石蟲啤酒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再在殼口放上一撮蒜末……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口朝上，把它們架在火上，烤一下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火舌撩著源石蟲的殼，激發出一陣麥香。\n油嗞嗞作響，大蒜的香味一陣陣傳來。\n直到一聲很輕，卻又代表著喜悅的聲音響起——\n——嗶啵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烤好了！要快點拿下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做的鬆餅也好囉！趕快過來一起吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好好吃喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把肉放在麵包上，配著辣椒一口吃下去，再喝口啤酒，試試看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，試試這鬆餅！裡面加了羽獸卵，一定香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上面五顏六色的是糖嗎？好甜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我也吃看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石蟲的觸角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！好好吃！很有嚼勁……但是好辣好辣！和先西做的飯味道很不一樣，但也很好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……加了啤酒的烤源石蟲吃起來不腥，辣炒源石蟲肉吃起來還是會有一股泥土的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然，不漏下任何一步做出來的料理，味道就是會更好一點，心急反而會造成不好的結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論是多麼小的一步，都需要仔細對待，這就是料理的魅力。瑪露希爾，你的著急給了老夫很大的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不是著急起來就什麼都不管了的人，我著急是因為你們太不著急了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺你們都是一副悠哉的樣子，根本沒辦法相信你們是真的急著回去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這啤酒也好喝！有一股別樣的麥香味，和我之前喝過的任何一種啤酒都不一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這樣說我就放心了。這些源石蟲啤酒是打算包裝成商品售賣的，今年釀了好幾批，看來能賺一筆錢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石蟲啤酒？用剛剛那些蟲子釀的嗎？怎麼做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方法有很多種，把牠們從出生起就養在乾淨的麥殼堆裡，牠們就會沾上麥殼，背上長的就是牠們自己形成的麥香殼子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用這些殼配著啤酒花釀，就能釀出這種啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過好像其他地方的人還有些別的方法，我聽說過餵啤酒花給源石蟲，再用牠們的黏液釀酒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能喝起來又是另一種風味——但我還是喜歡我釀的味道！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們剛才吃的鬆餅和啤酒也是一個道理，餵果子給那些閃亮亮的小傢伙，牠們的殼就能提取出甜美的風味來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們覺得啤酒好喝我也就放心了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的都很好吃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實瑪露希爾剛剛那麼著急，是因為我們可能……是誤打誤撞來到這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "54_g1_bobfarm"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，其實我根本沒聽懂你們在說什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……算了，我們可能還要去別的地方再問問了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過歸鄉心切，也是人之常情！別的部分我沒聽懂，但是這個部分我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你們什麼都不懂的樣子，糊裡糊塗地在外旅行是不太妙……這些都給你們吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大鮑勃趕緊包了一包剛處理好的源石蟲肉以及啤酒，然後連同一本冊子一起遞給了萊歐斯。\n萊歐斯翻開冊子，上面歪歪扭扭地寫著幾個看不太懂的字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這冊子是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，是《鮑勃的美食指南》！我把自己見過的東西，能吃的不能吃的都記錄在這本筆記裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿著吧，感覺你們看什麼都新奇，照著這本書來吧，這一路上別把自己餓死了或毒死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……完全是萊歐斯的喜好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不用看他的臉都知道他是什麼表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我知道一個地方，那裡有不少……呃，奇奇怪怪的人。他們一定可以幫你們想辦法找到你們的老家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們連紅眼女都能招架得住，解決你們的問題應該不是什麼麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的？是什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的辦事處都開到各種窮鄉僻壤去了，應該不難找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，我記下來了。羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）……奇怪的名字，是個島嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）要從海上出發嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你們真的到了羅德島，麻煩幫我和一個叫泥岩的傢伙問個好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就祝你們能找到羅德島！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……謝謝你啊，大塊頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是群有趣的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望他們能早點找到那個什麼……迷宮吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，幹活幹活！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯？剛剛剩下的那點吃的怎麼都沒了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道最後都被吃掉了？嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_2013_cerber_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煮過的源石蟲，真好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
